import{_ as o,o as i,c as t,a2 as n}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 299 | Shrouding-the-Heavens Decomposition | Source Masters and Source Arts: Shrouding-the-Heavens Version of Predatory Cultivation","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 299 | Shrouding-the-Heavens Decomposition | Source Masters and Source Arts: Shrouding-the-Heavens Version of Predatory Cultivation","no":299,"module":2,"tags":["Shrouding the Heavens","Source Master","Source Arts","Predatory Cultivation","Resource Monopoly"],"related":["04-Anti-Predation Core Thesis","18-Cultivation Resource Opening Mechanism","12-Life Circulation System Detailed"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0299_模块2-遮天-源天师与源术.md","filePath":"en/0299_模块2-遮天-源天师与源术.md"}'),s={name:"en/0299_模块2-遮天-源天师与源术.md"};function r(a,e,l,c,u,h){return i(),t("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[n('<h1 id="entry-299-shrouding-the-heavens-decomposition-source-masters-and-source-arts-shrouding-the-heavens-version-of-predatory-cultivation" tabindex="-1">Entry 299 | Shrouding-the-Heavens Decomposition | Source Masters and Source Arts: Shrouding-the-Heavens Version of Predatory Cultivation <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-299-shrouding-the-heavens-decomposition-source-masters-and-source-arts-shrouding-the-heavens-version-of-predatory-cultivation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 299 | Shrouding-the-Heavens Decomposition | Source Masters and Source Arts: Shrouding-the-Heavens Version of Predatory Cultivation&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Full Decomposition of the Shrouding-the-Heavens System (Entry 12) | Benchmark base: Documents 04, 18, 12</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-those-who-can-dig-source-hold-civilization-s-blood-drawing-needle" tabindex="-1">Introduction: Those who can &quot;dig Source&quot; hold civilization&#39;s blood-drawing needle <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-those-who-can-dig-source-hold-civilization-s-blood-drawing-needle" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: Those who can &quot;dig Source&quot; hold civilization&#39;s blood-drawing needle&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Among the six top-level axioms, the anti-predation axiom requires developing increments, not consuming stock. This entry specifically discusses Shrouding-the-Heavens world&#39;s &quot;Source Masters&quot; and &quot;Source Arts&quot; — this is a professional system that systematizes and esoterically transmits &quot;finding, mining, claiming mines&quot;; essentially Shrouding-the-Heavens version&#39;s predatory-cultivation industrial assembly line. The law-first axiom reminds: Source Arts&#39; monopolistic design is precisely the technical incarnation of Shrouding&#39;s zero-sum resource view. Protagonist uniqueness dependency = medium (oligarchic civilization). The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s evaluation base has been upgraded to six top-level axioms.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Source Arts system&#39;s energy waste:</p><ul><li>Source-seeking, claiming, locking process consumes massive cultivators&#39; wisdom and time, which could have been used to develop incremental energy</li><li>Once Source veins are found, they are usually circled by great clans and great sects, becoming private mines; public resources privatized</li><li>Source-Arts knowledge is family-esoterically transmitted, outsiders cannot learn; all society wastes repeating groping on &quot;not knowing where Source is&quot;</li></ul><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Source-Arts monopoly&#39;s regression consequences:</p><ol><li><strong>Resources rent-seeking</strong>: whoever knows Source Arts claims mines first; ordinary cultivators without Source Arts always lag one step</li><li><strong>Knowledge generational break</strong>: once a Source-Arts family declines, its vein-finding maps are lost; later generations re-grope</li><li><strong>Circle-land wars</strong>: Source-vein ownership triggers continuous contention; cosmos-tier energy consumed on &quot;grabbing mines&quot; rather than &quot;alchemy / cultivation / construction&quot;</li></ol><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Ye Fan&#39;s relationship with the Source-Arts system is typical of predatory cultivation:</p><ul><li><strong>Holds Source-seeking technology</strong>: Ye Fan&#39;s side holds high-tier Source Arts, meaning permanent first move in resource competition</li><li><strong>Source veins privatized</strong>: found Source veins go to their own faction, not opened to the whole cultivation world</li><li><strong>Technical barriers</strong>: Source Arts blockaded externally, forming a technical class where &quot;those who know take all, those who do not starve&quot;</li></ul><p>This is not Ye Fan&#39;s original evil, but the system he is in — Source-Arts families — has always been thus; Ye Fan only sat in the driver&#39;s seat of this predatory machine.</p><p>The Source-Arts system also has a deep consequence: it produces a kind of &quot;technological fatalism.&quot; Ordinary cultivators without Source Arts gradually believe &quot;I naturally cannot find Source, so this is my fate&quot; — technical monopoly not only monopolizes resources, but monopolizes people&#39;s self-perception. This fatalism is harder to break than resource scarcity itself, because it makes people stop trying to resist. Heng Yuan Zhou publicly publishing resource-exploration technology network-wide is not only to raise utilization, but to break this fatalism — let every ordinary cultivator know, not finding Source is not your fate, it is technology being hidden. Knowledge openness itself is liberation.</p><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Shrouding Source-Arts System</th><th>Anchor Symbiosis Alternative</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Source-seeking technology family-esoteric</td><td>Resource-exploration technology network-public, everyone can learn</td></tr><tr><td>Source veins circled and privatized</td><td>Resource distribution by joint contracting, Source veins are public resources</td></tr><tr><td>Mine-grabbing zero-sum competition</td><td>Develop increment Origin, not consume stock</td></tr><tr><td>Vein maps buried with families</td><td>Alaya records all mines, perpetually searchable</td></tr><tr><td>Those who know take all</td><td>Anti-Monopoly Law forbids resource-technology monopoly</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Modeling</strong>: replicate Source-Arts families&#39; technical monopoly and Source-vein distribution</li><li><strong>Variables</strong>: inject &quot;Source-Arts technology network-public&quot; vs. &quot;maintain family esoteric transmission&quot;</li><li><strong>Observation</strong>: whole-society average resource-acquisition cost, total Source-vein utilization</li><li><strong>Review</strong>: conclusion — technical monopoly cuts Source-vein total utilization by more than half; after openness civilization overall energy rises</li></ol><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Setting self-consistency: medium</strong>. Source-Arts system is finely designed early Shrouding, self-consistency acceptable; late Source-vein count and Source-Arts effect fluctuate with plot</li><li><strong>Retcon-ending risk: medium</strong>. Source-Arts&#39; wondrousness late can be adjusted by plot needs</li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency: medium</strong>. Ye Fan&#39;s side holds Source-Arts first move; oligarchic resource advantage thereby consolidated</li></ul><p>Source-Arts monopoly also produces a special contempt chain: those who know Source Arts look down on those who do not, even if the latter&#39;s combat power is higher. This contempt chain is harder to break than strength rank, because it is packaged as &quot;technical barriers.&quot; Heng Yuan Zhou making technology public is not only for resource utilization, but also to tear down this technical contempt chain — you can find mines, I can find mines too; between us no one is higher. Knowledge&#39;s democratization ultimately points to personality&#39;s equalization.</p><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: mine-finding technology secret, circle-land wars, repeated groping</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: Source-seeking technology esoteric = resource rent-seeking legalized</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo at least wanted to open martial-way knowledge; Shrouding even keeps mine-finding technology esoteric, knowledge monopoly deeper</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: ordinary cultivators and Myriad-Rank branches without Source Arts always at the bottom in resource competition</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: zero-sum mine-grabbing logic cannot support cross-multiverse resource collaboration</li><li><strong>Universal equal infinite law</strong>: basic infinite power is inherent in all; the easygoing retain a guarantee, strivers can superimpose higher; infinite origin erases predatory motivation, predatory involution loses meaning from the root</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Source Arts is not Shrouding-the-Heavens world&#39;s &quot;signature profession,&quot; but proof that it institutionalized predation — even &quot;where to loot from&quot; has become esoteric; this world&#39;s fairness never existed from the womb.</p><p>Source Arts&#39; secret is essentially &quot;making ordinary people feel they are not worthy.&quot; Heng Yuan Zhou making Source Arts public is not to make everyone a Source Master, but to let everyone no longer feel unworthy.</p><p>In the final analysis, Shrouding-the-Heavens · Source Masters and Source Arts described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./291_模块2-遮天-叶凡掠夺思维拆解.html">Entry 291 · Ye Fan Predatory Thinking</a> · <a href="./300_模块2-遮天-荒古世家.html">Entry 300 · Desolate Ancient Aristocratic Families</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/04-反掠夺主义核心论纲.html">04-Anti-Predation Core Thesis</a></li></ul>',31)])])}const m=o(s,[["render",r]]);export{g as __pageData,m as default};
